<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<title>FAQ — HeartCode Admin</title>
</head>
<body data-page="faq">
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('../partials/nav', { activePage: 'faq' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <h1 class="mb-2 font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-wide text-hc-ink">FAQ</h1>
    <p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-500">
      Questions and answers shown in the homepage's FAQ section, and in the FAQPage structured data search engines read from the same content.
      Add an "FAQ" section from the <a href="/<%= slug %>/landing-sections" class="text-hc-blue">Landing Sections</a> page to actually show this on the homepage — entries here have no effect until that section exists and is active.
      An inactive entry here is hidden from both the visible section and the structured data.
    </p>

    <div class="admin-card max-w-xl">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-hc-ink">Add question</h2>
      <form id="addFaqForm">
        <label class="admin-label" for="faqQuestion">Question</label>
        <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="question" id="faqQuestion" required placeholder="e.g. How long does it take to get my site?">
        <label class="admin-label" for="faqAnswer">Answer</label>
        <textarea class="admin-textarea" name="answer" id="faqAnswer" required placeholder="Shown when the question is expanded"></textarea>
        <button type="submit" class="admin-btn mt-3">Add question</button>
      </form>
      <p id="addFaqStatus" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p>
    </div>

    <div id="faqList" class="mt-6 space-y-3"></div>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
